    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337">

                <pb facs="0586" n="490" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v01/pg490"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9775: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-30T14:00:00-04:00">August 30, 1937—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>180. Nanking’s 554, August 29, 1 p.m., is repeated for communication by you to
                    your interested colleagues as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“If the Department approves please inform Tokyo that British, German,
                            Italian, French Embassies and I wish that our several ambassadors at
                            Tokyo would represent to the Japanese Government that the railway which
                            connects Hankow with Canton and Hong Kong is now being used by foreign
                            nationals being evacuated from China and that we hope that every care
                            will be used by Japanese military planes not to machine gun or bombard
                            trains or otherwise interrupt use of that line for evacuation of
                            foreigners.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <pb facs="0587" n="491" xml:id="pg491"/>
                <p>The Department approves of your associating yourself with your interested
                    colleagues in making appropriate representations to the Japanese Government in
                    regard to this matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
